{"seq":2,"slug":"async-loading","title":"异步加载与 IO 预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/streaming/async-loading","wordCount":1663,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步加载与-io-预算\">异步加载与 IO 预算</h1><p><a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a> 排好了一队该加载的 cell，现在要真把它们从磁盘搬进内存。这一步是流送里最容易把游戏卡住的地方：磁盘读取要等、解压要算、反序列化要构造成千上万个对象、注册到场景要改全局状态——任何一环挤进单帧都会掉帧。异步加载的全部工作，就是把这条「从字节到可玩 Actor」的流水线拆开、摊平、塞进后台，并给每个环节套上预算的笼头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>加载一个 cell 不是一次原子操作，而是一条<strong>多阶段流水线</strong>，每个阶段跑在不同资源上（磁盘、解压硬件、CPU、渲染线程），可以并行也必须限流。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[加载请求队列&lt;br/&gt;来自距离流送] --&gt; B[阶段1 读盘&lt;br/&gt;IO 线程 异步]&#10;    B --&gt; C[阶段2 解压&lt;br/&gt;硬件解压/GPU/CPU]&#10;    C --&gt; D[阶段3 反序列化&lt;br/&gt;构造对象 工作线程]&#10;    D --&gt; E[阶段4 后处理&lt;br/&gt;PSO预缓存/导航/物理]&#10;    E --&gt; F[阶段5 注册到场景&lt;br/&gt;主线程 必须切片]&#10;    F --&gt; G[cell 激活 可交互]&#10;    H[IO 预算&lt;br/&gt;每秒 MB 上限] -.限流.-&gt; B&#10;    I[时间预算&lt;br/&gt;每帧 ms 上限] -.限流.-&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[加载请求队列&lt;br/&gt;来自距离流送] --&gt; B[阶段1 读盘&lt;br/&gt;IO 线程 异步]\n    B --&gt; C[阶段2 解压&lt;br/&gt;硬件解压/GPU/CPU]\n    C --&gt; D[阶段3 反序列化&lt;br/&gt;构造对象 工作线程]\n    D --&gt; E[阶段4 后处理&lt;br/&gt;PSO预缓存/导航/物理]\n    E --&gt; F[阶段5 注册到场景&lt;br/&gt;主线程 必须切片]\n    F --&gt; G[cell 激活 可交互]\n    H[IO 预算&lt;br/&gt;每秒 MB 上限] -.限流.-&gt; B\n    I[时间预算&lt;br/&gt;每帧 ms 上限] -.限流.-&gt; F</pre><p>整条流水线的设计原则只有一句：<strong>只有最后一步「注册到场景」必须在主线程，其余全部赶到后台</strong>，而那最后一步还必须时间切片。下面拆解各阶段与两道预算闸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流水线五阶段-哪些能并行-哪些不能\">流水线五阶段：哪些能并行，哪些不能</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>跑在哪</th>\n<th>能否后台</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n<th>限流手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读盘</td>\n<td>IO 线程 / DMA</td>\n<td>是，完全异步</td>\n<td>磁盘带宽与寻址</td>\n<td>IO 预算（MB/s）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解压</td>\n<td>硬件解压 / GPU / CPU 工作线程</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>解压算力</td>\n<td>并发解压数上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反序列化</td>\n<td>CPU 工作线程</td>\n<td>大部分可</td>\n<td>构造对象、解引用</td>\n<td>工作线程池大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后处理</td>\n<td>工作线程 + 渲染线程</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>PSO 预缓存、导航烘焙、物理体创建</td>\n<td>分摊到多帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册到场景</td>\n<td>主线程（游戏线程）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>改场景图、注册 tick/碰撞</td>\n<td>时间切片，每帧限额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前四阶段是流送能「丝滑」的本钱——它们在玩家移动的同时悄悄跑完。真正的瓶颈是第五阶段：把构造好的 Actor 挂到场景图、注册进碰撞世界和 tick 列表，这些操作要改主线程独占的全局状态，无法并行。一个 cell 动辄上万个 Actor，全在一帧注册必然卡顿，所以第五阶段必须<strong>每帧只注册一批、剩下的下帧继续</strong>。后处理里的 PSO 预缓存尤其关键，它和卡顿的关系在 <a href=\"../practice/streaming-debugging\">流送调试与卡顿</a> 详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"io-预算-每秒只准读这么多\">IO 预算：每秒只准读这么多</h2><p>读盘虽在后台，也不能放任。一是物理带宽有限（<a href=\"../foundations/why-streaming\">为何世界流送</a> 算过，PS5 解压后峰值约 22 GB/s，单帧仅数百 MB），二是它要和纹理流送、音频流送、视频共享同一条 IO 通道。所以要给世界流送划一个 <strong>IO 预算</strong>——每秒最多读 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 字节。</p>\n<p>设待加载队列总字节为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，IO 预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（字节/秒），则清空队列的下界时间为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{drain} \\geq \\frac{S}{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式直接把「玩家移动速度」和「能否不出空洞」联系起来：若玩家以速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 推进，每秒新进入加载半径的 cell 数据量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\geq S_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时流送才跟得上；否则队列越积越长，玩家终将冲到尚未加载的区域。这正是为什么高速载具区要么压低资源密度（减小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、要么扩大 <a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">速度预测</a> 提前量（争取时间）。IO 预算还要随场景动态调：战斗激烈时给渲染让路、空旷赶路时全开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代-io-栈-directstorage-与硬件解压\">现代 IO 栈：DirectStorage 与硬件解压</h2><p>传统 PC 的加载路径绕远：SSD → 系统内存 → CPU 解压 → 再拷到显存，CPU 全程当二传手，大量时间花在拷贝和解压上。<strong>DirectStorage</strong> 把这条路拉直——让 GPU 直接从 NVMe 取数据并在 GPU 上解压，绕开 CPU 瓶颈。2026 年的 DirectStorage 1.4 引入了 Zstandard 编解码，进一步压低体积、加快流送，被寄望于「让纹理 pop-in 消失」。</p>\n<p>但 GPU 解压不是免费午餐：它和渲染抢同一套计算单元。Spider-Man 2 的 PC 版（2025 年初）就栽在这——DirectStorage 的 GPU 解压任务挤占了渲染算力，部分 NVIDIA 显卡上关掉它反而帧稳定性提升 18%~25%。这给出一个重要工程教训：<strong>解压预算和渲染预算共享 GPU，必须当成一个联合预算来分配</strong>，不能两边各自满载。主机（PS5）有专用解压芯片，把解压从 GPU 上卸下来，正是其流送丝滑的硬件底气。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间切片-把注册操作摊到多帧\">时间切片：把注册操作摊到多帧</h2><p>流水线最后一步——主线程注册——是卡顿的最后一道关。即便前面全异步，若某帧一次性激活一个含两万 Actor 的 cell，光是注册就吃掉几十毫秒，一个肉眼可见的卡顿就此产生。</p>\n<p><strong>时间切片（time-slicing）</strong> 的思路是给主线程上每帧的流送工作设一个时间预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（比如 2ms），处理注册队列直到本帧累计耗时逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 就停手，剩下的存着下帧接着干：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>本帧注册数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>τ</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{本帧注册数} = \\max\\left(1,\\ \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\tau}{\\bar{c}_{reg}} \\right\\rfloor \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本帧注册数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{c}_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8539em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单个 Actor 的平均注册耗时。这样一个大 cell 的激活被自然摊到若干帧，每帧只占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，主线程帧率稳住。代价是激活有了延迟——cell「请求完成」到「完全可交互」之间隔了几帧，所以时间切片要和 <a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a> 的速度预测配合：提前足够多就感知不到这点延迟。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 取值是又一个预算权衡：调大则切片少、激活快但单帧风险高；调小则丝滑但激活拖沓。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>加载一个 cell 是五阶段流水线：读盘 → 解压 → 反序列化 → 后处理 → 注册到场景；前四阶段全赶到后台，只有注册必须在主线程且必须切片。</li>\n<li>IO 预算限定每秒读取量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>；清队列时间下界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{drain}\\geq S/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，当玩家推进产生的数据率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，流送就跟不上、出现空洞。</li>\n<li>DirectStorage（2026 的 1.4 引入 Zstd）让 GPU 直读 NVMe 并解压、绕开 CPU；但 GPU 解压与渲染抢算力，Spider-Man 2 PC 版即为反例，解压与渲染须当联合预算分配。</li>\n<li>时间切片给主线程每帧设流送预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，把大 cell 的注册操作摊到多帧，稳住帧率，代价是激活延迟，需用速度预测补偿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>谁该被加入加载队列、按什么优先级：<a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a></li>\n<li>加载的反向——释放与内存记账：<a href=\"unloading-memory\">卸载与内存预算</a></li>\n<li>后处理里的 PSO 预缓存与卡顿诊断：<a href=\"../practice/streaming-debugging\">流送调试与卡顿</a></li>\n<li>跨库——GPU 侧的带宽与显存压力：<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks\">性能优化 · GPU 瓶颈</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步加载与 IO 预算","id":"异步加载与-io-预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线五阶段：哪些能并行，哪些不能","id":"流水线五阶段-哪些能并行-哪些不能"},{"level":2,"text":"IO 预算：每秒只准读这么多","id":"io-预算-每秒只准读这么多"},{"level":2,"text":"现代 IO 栈：DirectStorage 与硬件解压","id":"现代-io-栈-directstorage-与硬件解压"},{"level":2,"text":"时间切片：把注册操作摊到多帧","id":"时间切片-把注册操作摊到多帧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"按距离流送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/streaming/distance-based-streaming"},"next":{"title":"卸载与内存预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/streaming/unloading-memory"}}